{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_10_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_10","textTraditional":"一、十年，春，王二月，公會齊侯、鄭伯於中丘。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_10_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_10","textTraditional":"二、夏，翬帥師會齊人、鄭人伐宋。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_10_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_10","textTraditional":"三、六月，壬戌，公敗宋師於菅。辛未，取郜，辛巳，取防。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_10_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_10","textTraditional":"內不言戰，舉其大者也。取邑不日，此其日何也？不正其乘敗人而深為利，取二邑，故謹而日之也。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_10_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_10","textTraditional":"四、秋，宋人、衞人入鄭。宋人、蔡人、衞人伐載，鄭伯伐取之。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_10_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_10","textTraditional":"不正其因人之力而易取之，故主其事也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_10_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_10","textTraditional":"五、冬，十月，壬午，齊人、鄭人入郕。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_10_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_10","textTraditional":"入者，內弗受也。日入，惡入者也。郕，國也。","sentenceOrder":8}],"overrides":{}}